# Test lane artifacts (JUnit, traces, videos, k6 summaries) are regenerated and stay out of git.
# The release signatures beside them are the audit record FR-F044-13 depends on, so they stay tracked.
testing/evidence/**
!testing/evidence/README.md
!testing/evidence/*/
!testing/evidence/*/release.json
!testing/evidence/*/manifest.json
!testing/evidence/milestones/*.json

